cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "Short-Term Solar Irradiance Forecasting at Contrasting Colombian Sites"
abstract: >-
  Code accompanying a study of short-term global horizontal irradiance (GHI)
  forecasting from GOES-16 geostationary satellite imagery and ground measurements
  at two climatically contrasting Colombian sites, comparing graph-based and
  convolutional spatio-temporal deep learning with multisource fusion and an
  SGLD-based epistemic uncertainty layer.
type: software
