keywords:
  - solar irradiance forecasting
  - global horizontal irradiance
  - GOES-16
  - graph neural networks
  - GraphSAGE
  - convolutional neural networks
  - multisource fusion
  - epistemic uncertainty
  - Stochastic Gradient Langevin Dynamics
  - tropical Andean climate
  - Colombia
